                      |CKBChapter 4 - Worlds and Travel
                   |BKB-----------------------------------

|YKODarkwind spans multiple planets, worlds, regions, cities, wildernesses,
and hidden places. The old habit of memorizing one fixed list of continents
is no longer enough.

Use |YKBareas|YKO to browse every cataloged public area by world and region.
Use |YKBareas level <number>|YKO to find places near a level,
|YKBareas search <word>|YKO to search names and tags, and
|YKBareas info <number>|YKO to inspect a result. |YKBwhere|YKO identifies
your current location.

Wayshards are the main fast-travel network. Find one and
|YKBtouch shard|YKO to attune. Touch it again to view reachable destinations,
then use |YKBtravel <id>|YKO or |YKBtravel <area>|YKO. Characters through
level 10 automatically know the newbie-area shards. Travel is free, but has
a 60-second interval, stays on the same planet, and is blocked during or
shortly after combat.

Moongates connect planets. Ferries, ships, guild travel, and other methods
connect particular places. Read the local signs and use
|YKBhelp moongates|YKO or |YKBhelp ferries|YKO before setting out.

|YKBncot|YKO is the safest return for new characters. Later,
|YKBrecall|YKO can return you to the Center of Town when teleportation is
allowed, but it has a 15-minute cooldown.|000

